Package: OGRSCalculator
Type: Project
Title: Bilingual Shiny Calculator for the Offender Group Reconviction Scale 3
Version: 2.1.9
Authors@R: person("Merten", "Neumann", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Scoring, input validation, dataset processing and visualisation
    of OGRS 3 using the German coding by Breiling et al. (2022) and model
    coefficients by Howard et al. (2009). English is the default interface
    language, with a session-local German language selector.
